# In-Memory Repository Testing

## Purpose

`src/repositories/bling-in-memory.repository.ts` implements `IBlingRepository` without network I/O. Entity tests verify **wiring** — correct endpoint, id, params, and body passed to the repository.

## Setup Pattern

From `src/entities/camposCustomizados/__tests__/index.spec.ts`:

```
repository = new InMemoryBlingRepository()
entity = new CamposCustomizados(repository)
```

Instantiate the entity directly with the mock; do not use `Bling` facade in unit tests unless testing facade behavior specifically.

## Configuring Responses

| Method | Setter |
|--------|--------|
| Any (fallback) | `setResponse` |
| `index` | `setIndexResponse` |
| `show` | `setShowResponse` |
| `store` | `setStoreResponse` |
| `update` | `setUpdateResponse` |
| `replace` | `setReplaceResponse` |
| `destroy` | `setDestroyResponse` |

Verb-specific setters override the fallback for that method only.

## Spying

Use `jest.spyOn(repository, 'index' | 'show' | 'store' | 'update' | 'replace' | 'destroy')` to assert call arguments.

The in-memory implementation ignores options; spies capture what the entity passed.

## Random Input Data

Use `Chance` (`chance` package) for ids and optional fields to avoid brittle hard-coded values — see `src/entities/camposCustomizados/__tests__/index.spec.ts`.

Pick union values with `chance.pickone([...])` cast to shared types when needed.

## Headers Flag Tests

When entity sets `shouldIncludeHeadersInResponse: true`, assert it in `toHaveBeenCalledWith` — see `src/entities/homologacao/__tests__/index.spec.ts`.

## Cleanup

Always `jest.restoreAllMocks()` in `afterEach` to prevent spy leakage between tests.

## Extending the Mock

If `IBlingRepository` gains new methods, update `InMemoryBlingRepository` with matching setters and stubs before entity tests can use them. Keep parity with `src/repositories/bling.repository.interface.ts`.
